    {
      "Original": "Used by player or free company names if all their retainers, airships or submersibles are away.",
      "Translated": "当玩家或部队的所有雇员、飞空艇或潜水艇均外出时，用于其名称。",
      "Context": "[Accountant] ColorIdExtensions.Description",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Used by player or free company names if some their retainers, airships or submersibles are away and some are available.",
      "Translated": "当玩家或部队的部分雇员、飞空艇或潜水艇外出、部分可用时，用于其名称。",
      "Context": "[Accountant] ColorIdExtensions.Description",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Used by player or free company names if all their retainers, airships or submersibles are available.",
      "Translated": "当玩家或部队的所有雇员、飞空艇或潜水艇均可用时，用于其名称。",
      "Context": "[Accountant] ColorIdExtensions.Description",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Used by the Retainers and Machines headers if all retainers, airships or submersibles are away.",
      "Translated": "当所有雇员、飞空艇或潜水艇均外出时，用于雇员与机器标题。",
      "Context": "[Accountant] ColorIdExtensions.Description",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Used by the Retainers and Machines headers if some retainers, airships or submersibles are away and some are available.",
      "Translated": "当部分雇员、飞空艇或潜水艇外出、部分可用时，用于雇员与机器标题。",
      "Context": "[Accountant] ColorIdExtensions.Description",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Used by the Retainers and Machines headers if all retainers, airships or submersibles are available.",
      "Translated": "当所有雇员、飞空艇或潜水艇均可用时，用于雇员与机器标题。",
      "Context": "[Accountant] ColorIdExtensions.Description",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Used by single crops if they are withered.\nUsed by plot or player names if any of their crops is withered.",
      "Translated": "当单株作物枯萎时，用于该作物。\n当田地或玩家名称下任一作物枯萎时，用于该名称。",
      "Context": "[Accountant] ColorIdExtensions.Description",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Used by single crops if they are wilted.\nUsed by plot or player names if any of their crops are wilted and none are withered.",
      "Translated": "当单株作物凋萎时，用于该作物。\n当田地或玩家名称下任一作物凋萎且无枯萎时，用于该名称。",
      "Context": "[Accountant] ColorIdExtensions.Description",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Used by single crops if they are grown out.\nUsed by plot or player names if any of their crops are grown out and none are wilted or withered",
      "Translated": "当单株作物成熟时，用于该作物。\n当田地或玩家名称下任一作物成熟且无凋萎或枯萎时，用于该名称。",
      "Context": "[Accountant] ColorIdExtensions.Description",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Used by single crops if they are growing regularly.\nUsed by plot or player names if all of their crops are growing regularly.",
      "Translated": "当单株作物正常生长中时，用于该作物。\n当田地或玩家名称下所有作物均正常生长中时，用于该名称。",
      "Context": "[Accountant] ColorIdExtensions.Description",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Used by single crops if they are growing regularly and require no tending anymore.\nUsed by plot or player names if all of their crops are growing regularly and require no tending anymore.",
      "Translated": "当单株作物正常生长中且无需再照料时，用于该作物。\n当田地或玩家名称下所有作物均正常生长中且无需再照料时，用于该名称。",
      "Context": "[Accountant] ColorIdExtensions.Description",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Used by the Crops header and the collapsed header if any crop is withered.",
      "Translated": "当任一作物枯萎时，用于作物标题及折叠标题。",
      "Context": "[Accountant] ColorIdExtensions.Description",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Used by the Crops header and the collapsed header if any crop is wilted and none is withered.",
      "Translated": "当任一作物凋萎且无枯萎时，用于作物标题及折叠标题。",
      "Context": "[Accountant] ColorIdExtensions.Description",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Used by the Crops header and the collapsed header if any crop is grown out and none is wilted or withered.",
      "Translated": "用于作物标题栏和折叠标题栏，当有作物已成熟且没有枯萎或凋零时。",
      "Context": "[Accountant] ColorIdExtensions.Description",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Used by the Crops header and the collapsed header if all crops are growing regularly.",
      "Translated": "用于作物标题栏和折叠标题栏，当所有作物正常生长时。",
      "Context": "[Accountant] ColorIdExtensions.Description",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Used by the Crops header and the collapsed header if all crops are growing regularly and require no tending anymore.",
      "Translated": "用于作物标题栏和折叠标题栏，当所有作物正常生长且不再需要照料时。",
      "Context": "[Accountant] ColorIdExtensions.Description",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Used by Leve Allowances per player when you have accrued more than ",
      "Translated": "用于每位玩家的理符限额，当已累积超过",
      "Context": "[Accountant] ColorIdExtensions.Description",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek"
    },
    {
      "Original": " allowances.",
      "Translated": "个限额时。",
      "Context": "[Accountant] ColorIdExtensions.Description",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Used by Leve Allowances per player when you have accrued more than than ",
      "Translated": "用于每位玩家的理符限额，当已累积超过",
      "Context": "[Accountant] ColorIdExtensions.Description",
