    {
      "Original": "No full data about your current free company available.\n\nPlease leave your current instance or relog onto your character if this does not help to obtain Free Company Data after a Accountant Update.\n\nYou can disable this warning permanently in the settings.",
      "Translated": "无法获取当前部队的完整数据。\n\n如果 Accountant 更新后仍无法获取部队数据，请离开当前副本或重新登录角色。\n\n你可以在设置中永久禁用此警告。",
      "Context": "[Accountant] TimerWindow.DrawCompanyWarning",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Demolishing Houses",
      "Translated": "房屋拆除",
      "Context": "[Accountant] TimerWindow.DrawDemolition",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Outdoor crops only refresh every 63 minutes on a ward-specific update timer.\nAny timer may be delayed by up to 63 minutes.\nFertilizing a plant during these delays will automatically trigger updates.\nThey will still grow out/wilt/wither in order, and grown-out plants do not wither anymore.\nIndoors, clearing the house and re-entering should automatically trigger updates.\nYou can disable this tooltip in the configuration.",
      "Translated": "室外作物仅在每个分区特定的更新计时器上每 63 分钟刷新一次。\n任何计时器都可能延迟最多 63 分钟。\n在这些延迟期间施肥会自动触发更新。\n它们仍会按顺序成熟/枯萎/凋零，且已成熟的植物不再凋零。\n在室内，清空房屋并重新进入应会自动触发更新。\n你可以在配置中禁用此提示。",
      "Context": "[Accountant] CropCache.DrawTooltip",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek"
    },
