    {
      "Original": "The name entered here will replace all occurrences of the plot in the timer window.\n\nThe timer limit will show this house as due to be demolished in the timer window when the configured number of days passed since your last visit.\n\nThe warning timer limit will show notifications on the bottom right when the configured number of days passed since your last visit.\n\nYou need to manually add players that reset the timer when encountered within the house, otherwise the timer will not update.",
